349
00:37:44.710 --> 00:37:47.785
Kus me seda hoiaksime?
Kõikjal on suletud.

350
00:37:48.030 --> 00:37:49.330
Seal on kiriku saal,

351
00:37:49.430 --> 00:37:50.550
