436
00:44:11.100 --> 00:44:13.620
Mõned meie inimesed on ehitajad.
Nad võivad tulla ja...

437
00:44:13.620 --> 00:44:15.240
See pole turvaline, Yara.

438
00:44:15.340 --> 00:44:16.860
Sa tead seda.

439
00:44:16.960 --> 00:44:20.600
