465
00:50:19.600 --> 00:50:21.780
Palun võtke istet.

466
00:50:21.880 --> 00:50:24.030
Aitäh.

467
00:50:29.739 --> 00:50:34.440
Sa oled nagu meiegi.
Sa oled nagu meiegi. Kindel,

468
00:50:34.560 --> 00:50:36.835
