578
00:58:23.240 --> 00:58:26.515
Peab minema. See on solidaarsus,
mitte heategevus.

579
00:58:26.880 --> 00:58:30.005
See seisneb selles,
et me teeme midagi koos.

580
00:58:30.280 --> 00:58:32.600
Asi pole lihtsalt toiduainete
mahajätmises.

581
00:58:32.700 --> 00:58:35.450
Ma tahan, et see oleks jätkuv.

582
00:58:35.580 --> 00:58:37.280
Kas sa saad veel ühe?

583
00:58:37.380 --> 00:58:39.300
Ei, ei,

584
00:58:39.400 --> 00:58:41.725
