616
01:02:33.270 --> 01:02:35.870
Kas sellega on probleem?

617
01:02:36.070 --> 01:02:38.430
Ma ütlen sulle probleemi, Michela.

618
01:02:38.530 --> 01:02:40.030
Probleem on selles,
et me joome kogu aeg õlut,

619
01:02:40.130 --> 01:02:42.510
